  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A fish rising vertically upward with a uniform velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> observes that a bird is diving vertically downward towards the fish with the velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> If the refractive index of water is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then the&nbsp;actual velocity of the diving bird to pick the fish, will be<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>__________m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0066_a8ea3c4512db.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 197px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let the fish be at a depth&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;from the surface and let the bird be at height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;from the surface. So, with respect to fish</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Differentiating with respect to time,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}